msgctxt "#30545"
msgid "Emby only detects intros for TV episodes (Markers option of the TV library + 'Detect Episode Intros' scheduled task), never for movies. Credits markers require the EmbyCredits server plugin. Without a server marker, the fallback durations from the EmbyCon settings apply."
